            <ArticleTitle>Evidence-based practice in A&amp;E asthma management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>74-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article discusses the implementation of an evidence-based approach to acute asthma management. It describes how an emergency department changed the care of patients attending with asthma by conducting pre and post-implementation audits to measure success.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
